    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d201">

                <pb facs="0296" n="220" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg220"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.002/29</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Extracts]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-03T08:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 3, 1916, 8 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Resignation of Minister of Finance has been accepted and son of the President,
                    the Minister of Interior, has been appointed in his place. Peynado, Minister of
                    Justice, has been appointed to the Ministry of Interior.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
